{ Issue #157: <?:> binds weaker than <&>, so the whole concatenation is the ternary's condition.
  Kontakt takes no string as a condition, so this must not compile. }

// EXPECT_ERROR A condition must be a boolean, an integer or a real value, not a string\.
// EXPECT_ERROR wrap it in parentheses

on init
    message("Test: " & 3 > 0 ? "True" : "False")
end on
